-- 320(5): restoration "forthwith after the time for final appeal has expired": an "until" bar (ruling (d) of 2026-11-05): the matter cannot yet be restored until the time has expired.
-- src:6089 | Disposal of matter
-- src:6090 | (5) If the court is not satisfied that the publication referred to in subsection (1) is hate propaganda, it shall order that the matter be restored to the person from whom it was seized forthwith after the time for final appeal has expired.
