-- 320(8): the court is the one the province names; "means" closes it. All thirteen provinces and territories are named, so the answer is total.
DECLARE `s 320(8) the court` IS ONE OF
    `s 320(8)(a) the Court of Quebec`
    `s 320(8)(a.1) the Superior Court of Justice`
    `s 320(8)(b) the Court of Queen’s Bench`
    `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    `s 320(8)(e) the Nunavut Court of Justice`

-- src:6101 | court means
-- src:6102 | (a) in the Province of Quebec, the Court of Quebec,
-- src:6103 | (a.1) in the Province of Ontario, the Superior Court of Justice,
-- src:6104 | (b) in the Provinces of New Brunswick, Manitoba, Saskatchewan and Alberta, the Court of Queen’s Bench,
-- src:6105 | (c) [Repealed, 2026, c. 11, s. 7]
-- src:6106 | (c.1) [Repealed, 1992, c. 51, s. 36]
-- src:6107 | (d) in the Provinces of Nova Scotia, British Columbia, Prince Edward Island and Newfoundland and Labrador, in Yukon and in the Northwest Territories, the Supreme Court, and
-- src:6108 | (e) in Nunavut, the Nunavut Court of Justice; (tribunal)
@ref s 320(8) court (src:6101-6108)
GIVEN province IS A `Province or territory`
GIVETH A `s 320(8) the court`
`s 320(8) the court in the province` MEANS
    CONSIDER province
    WHEN Quebec THEN `s 320(8)(a) the Court of Quebec`
    WHEN Ontario THEN `s 320(8)(a.1) the Superior Court of Justice`
    WHEN `New Brunswick` THEN `s 320(8)(b) the Court of Queen’s Bench`
    WHEN Manitoba THEN `s 320(8)(b) the Court of Queen’s Bench`
    WHEN Saskatchewan THEN `s 320(8)(b) the Court of Queen’s Bench`
    WHEN Alberta THEN `s 320(8)(b) the Court of Queen’s Bench`
    WHEN `Nova Scotia` THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN `British Columbia` THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN `Prince Edward Island` THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN `Newfoundland and Labrador` THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN Yukon THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN `Northwest Territories` THEN `s 320(8)(d) the Supreme Court`
    WHEN Nunavut THEN `s 320(8)(e) the Nunavut Court of Justice`

-- src:6105 | (c) [Repealed, 2026, c. 11, s. 7]
@ref s 320(8)(c) (src:6105)
`s 320(8)(c) as the text shows it` MEANS "[Repealed, 2026, c. 11, s. 7]"

-- src:6106 | (c.1) [Repealed, 1992, c. 51, s. 36]
@ref s 320(8)(c.1) (src:6106)
